    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Oates Breheny Group presents No. 8 Glenard, Ballinode, a well-presented semi-detached three-bedroom, two-bathroom home located in the ever-popular Glenard development. The property features a tiled entrance hall with newly fitted carpet on the wooden staircase. The living room offers laminate flooring, an open fireplace, and double doors leading to the kitchen and dining area. The kitchen is fitted with lino flooring, a fully fitted kitchen, and a tiled splashback, with direct access to the rear garden. This level also benefits from convenient understairs storage. Upstairs, there is newly fitted carpet on the landing, leading to three bedrooms, two of which are double rooms, with one benefiting from its own en suite. There is also a shared family bathroom and hot press on this level. The property benefits from off-street parking to the front, along with a rear garden that includes side access from the front. This property is highly sought after due to its excellent location within walking distance of Atlantic Technological University Sligo, Sligo University Hospital, Sligo town centre, and is also conveniently located near a local bus route. To arrange a viewing, contact Oates Breheny Group on 071-9140404."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nGROUND FLOOR\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall  \r\nLaminate flooring. Wood staircase with newly fitted carpet to the stairs. \r\n\r\nLiving Room (4.1m x 5m) \r\nLaminate floor. Open fireplace. Double glass panel door to kitchen/ dining area. Decorative coving to ceiling with centre rose. \r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining (2.8m x 6.1m) \r\nLino flooring. Fully fitted kitchen. Tiled splashback. \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (3.86m x 2.79m) \r\nDouble room. Laminate flooring. Built in wardrobe. \r\nEn suite (2.2m x 1.2m) \r\nFully tiled. WC & WHB. Shower. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (3.85m x 2.8m) \r\nDouble room. Laminate flooring. Built in wardrobe. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (3.01m x 2.62m) \r\nSingle room. Laminate flooring. Built in wardrobe. \r\n\r\nBathroom (2.11m x 1.41m)\r\nLino flooring. Bath. WC & WHB. \r\n\r\nHotpress"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Oil fired central heating– with condenser boiler.\r\nPVC Double glazed windows.\r\nUnderstairs storage.\r\n6 panel regency doors.\r\nOff street private parking with tarmacadam driveway. \r\nNewly fitted carpet to stairs and landing. \r\nLocated in a popular residential development within walking distance of Atlantic Technological University Sligo, Sligo University Hospital and Sligo town centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C3"
      }
    ],
